ent inhibitors. During the study, any subject assigned to the SoC reporting group (excluding complement inhibitors) who had an Hb concentration \\\\>=2 g/dL below baseline or who presented with a qualifying thromboembolic event secondary to PNH was offered early escape therapy with pegcetacoplan.\",\"deathsNumAffected\":1,\"deathsNumAtRisk\":46,\"seriousNumAffected\":6,\"seriousNumAtRisk\":46,\"otherNumAffected\":35,\"otherNumAtRisk\":46},{\"id\":\"EG001\",\"title\":\"Standard of Care\",\"description\":\"Subjects continued to receive SoC treatment but were not allowed to receive treatment with a complement inhibitor unless they qualified for pegcetacoplan escape therapy.\",\"deathsNumAffected\":1,\"deathsNumAtRisk\":18,\"seriousNumAffected\":3,\"seriousNumAtRisk\":18,\"otherNumAffected\":12,\"otherNumAtRisk\":18}],\"seriousEvents\":[{\"term\":\"Febrile neutropenia\",\"organSystem\":\"Blood and lymphatic system disorders\",\"sourceVocabulary\":\"MedDRA 23.0\",\"assessmentType\":\"SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT\",\"stats\":[{\"groupId\":\"EG000\",\"numEvents\":1,\"numAffected\":1,\"numAtRisk\":46},{\"groupId\":\"EG001\",\"numEvents\":1,\"numAffected\":1,\"numAtRisk\":18}]},{\"term\":\"Neutropenia\",\"organSystem\":\"Blood and lymphatic system disorders\",\"sourceVocabulary\":\"MedDRA 23.0\",\"assessmentType\":\"SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT\",\"stats\":[{\"groupId\":\"EG000\",\"numEvents\":1,\"numAffected\":1,\"numAtRisk\":46},{\"groupId\":\"EG001\",\"numEvents\":0,\"numAffected\":0,\"numAtRisk\":18}]},{\"term\":\"Pancytopenia\",\"organSystem\":\"Blood and lymphatic system disorders\",\"sourceVocabulary\":\"MedDRA 23.0\",\"assessmentType\":\"SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT\",\"stats\":[{\"groupId\":\"EG000\",\"numEvents\":1,\"numAffected\":1,\"numAtRisk\":46},{\"groupId\":\"EG001\",\"numEvents\":0,\"numAffected\":0,\"numAtRisk\":18}]},{\"term\":\"Bone marrow failure\",\"organSystem\":\"Blood and lymphatic system disorders\",\"sourceVocabulary\":\"MedDRA 23.0\",\"assessmentType\":\"SYSTEMATIC_AS